  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV/AIDS Prevention, Care and Support for Key Populations, PLHIV and General Population - Liberia (01-Apr-2016-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia, HIV, Population Services International (PSI HQ)This program has the following goals: Keep PLHIV alive and healthy in Liberia.  To mitigate socio-economic impact on people infected and affected by HIV and AIDS in Liberia.  To stop new HIV infections in Liberia. The objectives of this program are: Strengthen national health and community systems.  To increase access to HIV prevention and treatment services.  To increase care and support for PLHIV.  To provide HIV prevention information and services to key and vulnerable populations</narrative>
  </description>
